{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23ef795d5ad45a8e2fa075fcc735af99e78a0732947ac01c5edb6a110a0e608e",
      "text": "时尚品牌的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7055564a84cd6cab47e850b2ddf63098389e0642a2a7e09de8089047c0bf6980",
      "text": "…时尚品牌的形象代言人吗。\n我会全力以赴胜任的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21c1a97bc2683eb611f1f6b5532d17e2a48f4532f9869f01e0b49da436831df4",
      "text": "客户指名务必请一希先生\n来担任形象代言人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f86a95692432be83445e43afd9368128276a5f052dee37ad22ddf3795550b1d",
      "text": "…这样啊。能被这么说很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:370e378a509c2ea7c770bcb68832372967be333541c4fd9d09c0d99394cedc66",
      "text": "…这个品牌的衣服，我以前写小说时\n曾经参考过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77e2e173458c4bf5e3d6609c55cc22bbfbb81641b3982b50f1f51e6a5a6671e7",
      "text": "…那时候可做梦也没想到，\n自己竟然会成为被看的那一方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:617195078d3eeb5eb7d3e15957a4b8e7fd8fc77fa0906d84ef40d461e789c680",
      "text": "…虽然像小说里的台词一样，\n但以前的我若是知道了肯定会吓一跳吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6848dfaa2885d85aa7e15184df7e407a27121f87da40b0c35b797cf9303a83fe",
      "text": "做偶像工作的话，\n以后说不定还会有产生同样感慨的机会呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68ab339525c9e5d1ea32d4c702ea8867af1eff2399b38b84e9ab67b560469109",
      "text": "…嗯。\n我一定会圆满完成这份工作，去迎接那样的机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a998842e4119a7c0e8b095797f19acad252a86bfbc4a8d73bbac5d4551dfbab8",
      "text": "…因为我也想回应促成这份工作的\n●●●●プロデューサー的期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_02:1_5_043_02:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:762a88b6eddadf8b8836e8b2c1de5dcb5be94d858c63a65db2dfd277e9d253e1",
      "text": "…差不多准备就绪了。\n我去换服装。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
